  {
    "uuid": "4b84ffdf-894c-5ffc-85f2-8e9c00ae8154",
    "entry": "炊婦",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "すいふ",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "(female) cook",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "その炊婦は毎日未明から厨房に立っていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "炊婦の工夫で、限られた食材も美味しい食事に変わった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "兵舎の炊婦は百人分の食事を一人で用意していた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "俺達はすよりは、妄想をデツチ上げた恋愛小説でも作つて、破鍋にトヂ蓋の下宿屋の炊婦でも覘つたら可からう。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "犬物語",
                "author": "内田魯庵",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "しかもこれは笑いやすいふうではない、落ち着いた人が酒瓶の役に選ばれてあったのである。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "源氏物語",
                "author": "乙女",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
